# Craft App Suite apps installed for every user at first login by
# first-login.sh (step artcraft-apps), as user Flatpak bundles from each
# app's latest GitHub release, exactly as ArtCraft Launcher installs them on
# image-based systems. The launcher detects them and manages their updates.
# Source of this list: storytold/craft-launcher crates/core/catalog.toml.
# Community apps (SolidCraft, MailCraft) are left to the launcher.
#
# id            flatpak-id                       github-repo
photocraft      ai.storyteller.photocraft        storytold/photocraft
vectorcraft     ai.storyteller.vectorcraft       storytold/vectorcraft
filmcraft       ai.storyteller.filmcraft         storytold/filmcraft
lightcraft      ai.storyteller.lightcraft        storytold/lightcraft
pdfcraft        ai.storyteller.pdfcraft          storytold/pdfcraft
effectcraft     ai.storyteller.effectcraft       storytold/effectcraft
anicraft        ai.storyteller.anicraft          storytold/anicraft
designcraft     ai.storyteller.designcraft       storytold/designcraft
figcraft        ai.storyteller.figcraft          storytold/figcraft
soundcraft      ai.storyteller.soundcraft        storytold/soundcraft
wordcraft       ai.storyteller.wordcraft         storytold/wordcraft
deckcraft       ai.storyteller.deckcraft         storytold/deckcraft
cadcraft        ai.storyteller.cadcraft          storytold/cadcraft
gridcraft       ai.storyteller.gridcraft         storytold/gridcraft
texturecraft    ai.storyteller.texturecraft      storytold/texturecraft
materialcraft   ai.storyteller.materialcraft     storytold/materialcraft
craft-anything  ai.storyteller.craft-anything    storytold/craft-anything
